{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375940/extras/deea9edf01e3f57622f716a545196b27.avif?t=1757531121\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> is a chaotic and fun multiplayer party game where players compete in a series of unique <strong>minigames!</strong> Customize your frog and dive in with your friends to test your skills in thrilling challenges. From obstacle races to epic naval battles, and even hide-and-seek games in Prop Hunt style. With gameplay that is both accessible and engaging, <strong>Frogz</strong> is the perfect choice for unforgettable game nights. Get ready for limitless fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> is a free to play, 3D Party Multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+10 Maps all different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your frogz.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frogz</strong> will always be 100% free to play, with no pay-to-win advantages!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3375940?t=1757531121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757531121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375940/f4cc78e4ee4913e6b3598794d10e2b1f2711124a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757531121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375940/f4cc78e4ee4913e6b3598794d10e2b1f2711124a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757531121","categorie